
|WKBSyntax: |YKBequip
 
|WKBDESCRIPTION
|WKO===========
 
|YKOThis command will quickly wear all your armour and wield your weapon.
Be warned though, it is not a foolproof way to get equiped with the
best of all your equipment you might be carrying.  After equipping,
make sure you are wearing and using the correct armours and weapons.

Use |CKBloadout|YKO when you want to save and switch between named,
repeatable equipment configurations.

Use |CKBsmartequip|YKO when you want the game to compare directly carried
armour and weapons with |CKBgearcheck|YKO scores, fill open slots, and attempt
to equip the stronger choices.
